      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17051610134822912
    m_Localized: "\u0110\xEAm qua ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng t\xE0i n\xE0o ng\u1EE7
      n\u1ED5i. C\u1EE9 m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n nh\u1EAFm m\u1EAFt l\u1EA1i, nh\u1EEFng
      ti\u1EBFng th\xE9t \u1EA5y l\u1EA1i vang v\u1ECDng b\xEAn tai. C\u1EA3 nh\u1EEFng
      \xE2m thanh \u1EA9m \u01B0\u1EDBt kinh t\u1EDFm \u0111\xF3 n\u1EEFa. C\u1EA3
      ti\u1EBFng kh\xF3c l\xF3c. Khi b\xECnh minh r\u1ED1t cu\u1ED9c c\u0169ng l\xF3
      r\u1EA1ng, ch\xFAng t\xF4i k\xE9o r\xE8m c\u1EEDa ra. C\u1EA3nh t\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      d\u01B0\u1EDBi s\xE2n v\u01B0\u1EDDn l\xE0 m\u1ED9t cu\u1ED9c th\u1EA3m s\xE1t
      kinh ho\xE0ng. Nh\u1EEFng chi\u1EBFc l\xE1 xanh gi\u1EDD b\u1ECB nhu\u1ED9m
      m\u1ED9t m\xE0u \u0111\u1ECF th\u1EABm \u2014 gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE3 kh\xF4 l\u1EA1i
      v\xE0 hoen \u1ED1. Nh\u1EEFng c\xE1i x\xE1c. Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\u0169 zombie.
      L\xE0 con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. B\u1ECB x\xE9 x\xE1c tan t\xE0nh. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      \u0111\u1EE9ng tr\xE2n tr\xE2n nh\xECn r\u1EA5t l\xE2u. Kh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t ai
      n\xF3i n\u0103ng g\xEC. N\u1EBFu nh\u01B0 h\xF4m qua ch\xFAng t\xF4i t\u1EADn
      m\u1EAFt ch\u1EE9ng ki\u1EBFn c\u1EA3nh t\u01B0\u1EE3ng n\xE0y thay v\xEC ch\u1EC9
      nghe th\u1EA5y th\xF4i\u2026 c\xF3 l\u1EBD c\u1EA3 l\u0169 s\u1EBD ch\u1EB3ng
      bao gi\u1EDD d\xE1m b\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\xE2n ra kh\u1ECFi c\u0103n ph\xF2ng n\xE0y
      n\u1EEFa. M\xE0 th\u1EF1c ra gi\u1EDD c\u0169ng ch\u1EB3ng ai mu\u1ED1n ra
      ngo\xE0i l\xE0m g\xEC. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i ng\u1ED3i im l\u1EB7ng su\u1ED1t c\u1EA3
      ng\xE0y tr\u1EDDi. Suy ngh\u0129. V\u1EC1 cu\u1ED9c \u0111\u1EDDi. V\u1EC1
      con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. V\u1EC1 l\xFD do t\u1EA1i sao ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EABn
      c\xF2n \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111ang sinh t\u1ED3n v\xEC c\xE1i
      g\xEC ch\u1EE9? Ch\u1EB3ng ai t\xECm ra c\xE2u tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi n\xE0o c\u1EA3.
      Nh\u01B0ng d\xF9 v\u1EADy, \u0111\u1EA7u \xF3c c\u1EA3 l\u0169 v\u1EABn kh\xF4ng
      th\u1EC3 ng\u1EEBng suy ngh\u0129 qu\u1EA9n quanh."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17052569925795840
    m_Localized: "B\xE2y gi\u1EDD ch\xFAng t\xF4i lu\xF4n k\xE9o r\xE8m c\u1EEDa
      k\xEDn m\xEDt. Kh\xEDt r\u1ECBt. Kh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t khe h\u1EDF. Kh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t
      ch\xFAt \xE1nh s\xE1ng. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng mu\u1ED1n nh\xECn ra b\xEAn
      ngo\xE0i n\u1EEFa. S\xE2n v\u01B0\u1EDDn. M\xE0u \u0111\u1ECF th\u1EABm \u1EA5y.
      S\u1EF1 im l\u1EB7ng ch\u1EBFt ch\xF3c bao tr\xF9m sau \u0111\xF3. Trong b\xF3ng
      t\u1ED1i, nh\u1EEFng suy ngh\u0129 c\u1EE9 th\u1EBF \u1EADp \u0111\u1EBFn.
      Ch\xFAng ch\u1EB3ng th\xE8m g\xF5 c\u1EEDa. C\u1EE9 th\u1EBF tu\xF4n tr\xE0o
      v\xE0o \u0111\u1EA7u. K\u1EF7 ni\u1EC7m. S\u1EF1 h\u1ED1i ti\u1EBFc. Nh\u1EEFng
      c\xE2u h\u1ECFi ch\u1EB3ng bao gi\u1EDD c\xF3 l\u1EDDi gi\u1EA3i \u0111\xE1p.
      R\u1ED3i n\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EAFt c\u1EE9 th\u1EBF tr\xE0o ra. Ban \u0111\u1EA7u
      c\xF2n kh\u1EBD kh\xE0ng. Sau \u0111\xF3 c\u1EE9 ngh\u1EB9n ng\xE0o, n\u1EE9c
      n\u1EDF h\u01A1n. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ng\u0103n ch\xFAng l\u1EA1i
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. M\xE0 c\u0169ng ch\u1EB3ng mu\u1ED1n ng\u0103n l\xE0m
      g\xEC. V\xE0 r\u1ED3i \u2014 nh\u1EEFng suy ngh\u0129 nguy hi\u1EC3m b\u1EAFt
      \u0111\u1EA7u nhen nh\xF3m. T\u1EA1i sao ph\u1EA3i ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c c\u1ED1
      g\u1EAFng ch\u1EE9? T\u1EA1i sao c\u1EE9 ph\u1EA3i ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EA5u
      tranh l\xE0m g\xEC? C\xF3 l\u1EBD m\u1ECDi chuy\u1EC7n s\u1EBD d\u1EC5 d\xE0ng
      h\u01A1n n\u1EBFu ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\u1EE9 th\u1EBF\u2026 d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i.
      Bu\xF4ng xu\xF4i t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 ngh\u0129 v\u1EC1
      \u0111i\u1EC1u \u0111\xF3. L\xE2u h\u01A1n m\u1EE9c cho ph\xE9p. Nh\u01B0ng
      r\u1ED1t cu\u1ED9c, ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EABn \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y. V\u1EABn \u0111ang
      th\u1EDF. V\u1EABn \u0111ang tr\u1EEBng tr\u1EEBng nh\xECn v\xE0o b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i.
      Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\u0169ng ch\u1EB3ng bi\u1EBFt \u0111i\u1EC1u \u0111\xF3 bi\u1EBFn
      c\u1EA3 l\u0169 th\xE0nh nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB m\u1EA1nh m\u1EBD, hay ch\u1EC9
      l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB qu\xE1 h\xE8n nh\xE1t kh\xF4ng d\xE1m ra \u0111i."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17054413288849408
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i l\u1EA1i k\xE9o r\xE8m c\u1EEDa ra l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa.
      Ch\u1EC9 m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt th\xF4i. Nh\u1EEFng v\u1EC7t m\xE1u \u0111\u1ECF
      th\u1EABm tr\xEAn nh\u1EEFng b\u1EE9c t\u01B0\u1EDDng ngo\xE0i s\xE2n v\u01B0\u1EDDn
      gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE3 s\u1EADm m\xE0u h\u01A1n. Kh\xF4 kh\u1ED1c. Keo l\u1EA1i
      trong c\xE1c k\u1EBD n\u1EE9t. D\u01B0\u1EDBi th\u1EE9 \xE1nh s\xE1ng n\xE0y,
      ch\xFAng tr\xF4ng g\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 chuy\u1EC3n sang m\xE0u \u0111en. Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i l\u1EA1i l\xF4i cu\u1ED1n s\xE1ch c\u0169 ra \u0111\u1ECDc. C\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n
      v\u1EC1 c\u1EADu b\xE9 b\u1ECB m\u1EAFc k\u1EB9t tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc
      thuy\u1EC1n c\xF9ng v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t con h\u1ED5. Ho\u1EB7c l\xE0 nh\u1EA3y
      xu\u1ED1ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m m\u1ED3i cho c\xE1 m\u1EADp,
      ho\u1EB7c l\xE0 \u1EDF l\u1EA1i tr\xEAn b\xE8 v\xE0 ch\u1EDD con h\u1ED5 v\u1ED3
      l\u1EA5y m\xECnh khi c\u01A1n \u0111\xF3i c\u1EE7a n\xF3 chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng.
      Ng\u0103n c\xE1ch gi\u1EEFa hai b\xEAn ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 v\xE0i th\u01B0\u1EDBc
      v\xE1n g\u1ED7. Ch\u1EC9 th\u1EBF th\xF4i. Kh\xF4ng t\u01B0\u1EDDng th\xE0nh.
      Kh\xF4ng c\u1EEDa ng\xF5. Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 s\u1EF1 tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng, n\u1ED7i
      s\u1EE3 h\xE3i v\xE0 ch\u1EB3ng c\xF2n n\u01A1i n\xE0o kh\xE1c \u0111\u1EC3
      \u0111i. Nghe quen thu\u1ED9c ch\u1EE9? Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111ang \u1EDF t\u1EA7ng
      5. Ngay ph\xEDa d\u01B0\u1EDBi ch\xE2n l\xE0 c\xE1i ch\u1EBFt. Bao b\u1ECDc
      xung quanh l\xE0 s\u1EF1 im l\u1EB7ng ch\u1EBFt ch\xF3c. V\xE0 ph\xEDa sau
      c\xE1nh c\u1EEDa kia, c\xF3 l\u1EBD m\u1ECDi chuy\u1EC7n c\u0169ng ch\u1EB3ng
      kh\xE1 kh\u1EA9m h\u01A1n. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng c\xF3 m\u1ED9t con h\u1ED5.
      Nh\u01B0ng ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF3 nhau. V\xE0 \u0111\xF4i khi, nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF
      l\xE0 \u0111\u1EE7. Nh\u01B0ng \u0111\xF4i khi, l\u1EA1i kh\xF4ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17055232415449088
    m_Localized: "\u0110\u1EC3 gi\u1EBFt th\u1EDDi gian, ch\xFAng t\xF4i b\u1EAFt
      \u0111\u1EA7u vi\u1EBFt nh\u1EEFng c\xE1i t\xEAn l\xEAn m\u1EA5y m\u1EA3nh
      gi\u1EA5y v\u1EE5n. B\u1EA1n b\xE8. B\u1EA1n c\xF9ng l\u1EDBp. Nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      ch\xFAng t\xF4i t\u1EEBng m\u01B0\u1EE3n v\u1EDF ch\xE9p b\xE0i. C\xF4 b\u1EA1n
      l\xFAc n\xE0o c\u0169ng chia s\u1EBB ph\u1EA7n \u0103n tr\u01B0a c\u1EE7a m\xECnh.
      C\u1EADu ch\xE0ng bu\u1ED5i h\u1ECDc n\xE0o c\u0169ng l\u0103n ra ng\u1EE7
      g\u1EADt. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i vi\u1EBFt l\u1EA1i nh\u1EEFng \u0111i\u1EC1u nh\u1ECF
      nh\u1EB7t \u2014 ti\u1EBFng c\u01B0\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD, nh\u1EEFng tr\xF2
      \u0111\xF9a nh\u1EA1t nh\u1EBDo, hay d\xE1ng \u0111i quen thu\u1ED9c. Nh\u1EEFng
      k\xFD \u1EE9c v\u1EE5n v\u1EB7t. Ch\u1EB3ng c\xF3 g\xEC to t\xE1t. Nh\u01B0ng
      vi\u1EC7c vi\u1EBFt ch\xFAng ra c\u1EA3m gi\xE1c nh\u01B0 \u0111ang gi\u1EEF
      cho h\u1ECD c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng v\u1EADy. C\xF3 l\u1EBD ch\xFAng t\xF4i s\u1EBD
      kh\xF4ng s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t qua chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\u0169ng
      kh\xF4ng mong c\xF3 ai \u0111\xF3 s\u1EBD \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      nh\u1EEFng trang gi\u1EA5y n\xE0y. \u0110\xF3 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 l\xFD
      do ch\xFAng t\xF4i vi\u1EBFt. Ch\u1EC9 l\xE0\u2026 vi\u1EC7c kh\u01A1i l\u1EA1i
      nh\u1EEFng k\xFD \u1EE9c gi\xFAp ch\xFAng t\xF4i qu\xEAn \u0111i. Trong m\u1ED9t
      kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc, ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng c\xF2n \u1EDF trong c\u0103n
      ph\xF2ng n\xE0y n\u1EEFa. Kh\xF4ng c\xF2n \u0111\xF3i kh\xE1t. Kh\xF4ng c\xF2n
      s\u1EE3 h\xE3i. Ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01A1n thu\u1EA7n l\xE0 nh\u1EDB l\u1EA1i.
      V\xE0 v\u1EDBi ng\xE0y h\xF4m nay, th\u1EBF l\xE0 \u0111\u1EE7 r\u1ED3i."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17056515440459776
    m_Localized: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 kho\u1EA3ng cu\u1ED1i th\xE1ng M\u1ED9t. Ng\xE0y
      \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i sau k\u1EF3 ngh\u1EC9 l\u1EC5. Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 h\xE1o h\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
      th\u1EADt s\u1EDBm \u2014 ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1EB7p l\u1EA1i b\u1EA1n
      b\xE8. \u0110\u1EC3 h\xE0n huy\xEAn. \u0110\u1EC3 c\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF9a
      v\u1EC1 nh\u1EEFng chuy\u1EC7n kh\xF4ng \u0111\xE2u. Bu\u1ED5i s\xE1ng h\xF4m
      \u0111\xF3, m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 v\u1EABn di\u1EC5n ra ho\xE0n to\xE0n b\xECnh
      th\u01B0\u1EDDng. R\u1ED3i \u0111\u1ED9t nhi\xEAn, b\xE3o t\u1ED1 \u1EADp \u0111\u1EBFn.
      Gi\u1EA3ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng ch\xE0o \u0111\xF3n ch\xFAng t\xF4i.
      C\xE1c gi\xE1o s\u01B0 c\u0169ng v\u1EADy. Th\u1EE9 \u0111\xF3n ti\u1EBFp ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i l\xE0 m\u1ED9t c\u1EA3nh t\u01B0\u1EE3ng m\xE0 c\u1EA3 l\u0169 s\u1EBD
      kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD qu\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. M\u1ED9t v\xE0i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      b\u1EA1n c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh c\xFAp
      h\u1ECDc m\u1EA5y ng\xE0y \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn. \u1EDE l\u1EA1i nh\xE0 th\xEAm
      m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt. H\u1ECD th\u1EADt may m\u1EAFn. Li\u1EC7u h\u1ECD c\xF3 \u0111\xFAng
      kh\xF4ng? Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng bi\u1EBFt. C\xF3 th\u1EC3 gi\u1EDD h\u1ECD
      \u0111ang an to\xE0n \u1EDF m\u1ED9t n\u01A1i n\xE0o \u0111\xF3. C\u0169ng
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0 kh\xF4ng. C\xF3 l\u1EBD vi\u1EC7c quay l\u1EA1i tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
      s\u1EDBm l\xE0 quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh t\u1ED3i t\u1EC7 nh\u1EA5t m\xE0 ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i t\u1EEBng \u0111\u01B0a ra. Nh\u01B0ng l\xFAc \u0111\xF3 \u0111\xE2u
      ai bi\u1EBFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. Ch\u1EB3ng m\u1ED9t ai bi\u1EBFt c\u1EA3.
      V\xE0 gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE2y, m\u1ECDi chuy\u1EC7n \u0111\xE3 qu\xE1 mu\u1ED9n
      \u0111\u1EC3 quay \u0111\u1EA7u r\u1ED3i."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17057436421537792
    m_Localized: "Ki\u1EC3m tra h\xF4m nay:\r\n- \u0110\u1ED3 \u0103n: \u1ED4n\r\n-
      Nhu y\u1EBFu ph\u1EA9m: \u1ED4n\r\n- Ph\xF2ng \u1ED1c: \u1ED4n\r\n- Th\u1EDDi
      ti\u1EBFt: Tr\u1EDDi quang\r\n- Tin t\u1EE9c: Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\xEC\r\nKh\xF4ng
      c\xF2n g\xEC kh\xE1c. Kh\xF4ng \u0111\xF3i. Kh\xF4ng no. Ch\u1EC9 l\xE0...
      \u1ED5n. \u1ED4n ngh\u0129a l\xE0 \u1ED5n. Ng\xE0y mai c\u0169ng s\u1EBD l\u1EA1i
      nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0y th\xF4i. Vi\u1EBFt th\xEAm \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m g\xEC
      n\u1EEFa ch\u1EE9? Ch\u1EA3 bi\u1EBFt n\u1EEFa. Nh\u01B0ng t\xF4i v\u1EABn
      \u0111ang vi\u1EBFt \u0111\xE2y. Th\u1EBF c\u0169ng l\xE0 m\u1ED9t \u0111i\u1EC1u
      g\xEC \u0111\xF3 r\u1ED3i. Ch\u1EAFc v\u1EADy.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17058595156738048
    m_Localized: "Nh\u1EEFng vi\u1EC7c ph\u1EA3i l\xE0m sau chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y:\r\n-
      V\u1EC1 nh\xE0. M\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n. \xCDt nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy.\r\n-
      \u0102n t\u1EA5t t\u1EA7n t\u1EADt m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9. M\u1ECDi m\xF3n \u0103n.
      T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 b\u1ECDn ch\xFAng.\r\n- \u0110i du l\u1ECBch \u0111\xE2u \u0111\xF3
      th\u1EADt xa. B\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 \u0111\xE2u. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i
      \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y.\r\n- H\u1ECDc m\u1EA5y th\u1EE9 v\u1EC1 sinh t\u1ED3n.
      Sinh t\u1ED3n th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF \u1EA5y. Ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ng\u1ED3i
      xem video.\r\n- S\u1ED1ng m\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n lo ngh\u0129. Lo l\u1EAFng
      \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m g\xEC c\u01A1 ch\u1EE9? D\xF9 sao th\xEC ng\xE0y mai ch\u1EAFc
      g\xEC \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EBFn..\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17059989490188288
    m_Localized: "Ki\u1EC3m tra h\xF4m nay:\r\n- M\u01B0a. Nh\u1EEFng v\u1EC7t m\xE1u
      \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB g\u1ED9t r\u1EEDa s\u1EA1ch s\u1EBD.\r\n- M\u1EA5y con v\u1ECBt
      \u0111i ngang qua s\xE2n v\u01B0\u1EDDn. L\u1EA7n n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n l\u1EA1i
      3 con.\r\n- Kh\xF4ng kh\xED: M\xE1t m\u1EBB.\r\n- T\u1EA7ng 5 c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng
      ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 cao l\u1EAFm. C\xF3 l\u1EBD v\u1EADy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17061652716273664
    m_Localized: "Ki\u1EC3m tra h\xF4m nay:\r\n- Tr\u1EDDi \xE2m u. Gi\xF3 th\u1ED5i
      m\u1EA1nh. M\xE2y \u0111en \u0111ang k\xE9o tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i.\r\n- L\u0169
      v\u1ECBt d\xE1o d\xE1c ch\u1EA1y. Tan t\xE1c.\r\n- Th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u0111\xF3
      b\xEAn ngo\xE0i \u0111\xE3 v\u1EE1. B\u1ECB gi\xF3 qu\u1EADt \u0111\u1ED5.\r\n-
      C\u1EA3m gi\xE1c nh\u01B0 \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t th\u1EDDi \u0111i\u1EC3m
      th\xEDch h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17062383200452608
    m_Localized: "Ki\u1EC3m tra h\xF4m nay:\r\n- C\xF3 ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng
      \u0111\xE2u \u0111\xF3 tr\xEAn t\u1EA7ng 5. Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i. Kh\xF4ng ch\u1EAFc l\xE0 t\u1EEB \u0111\xE2u.\r\n- Gi\xF3 th\u1ED5i
      r\u1EA5t m\u1EA1nh. B\xEAn ngo\xE0i m\u1ED9t m\xE0u xanh m\u01B0\u1EDBt. Th\u1EADm
      ch\xED xanh \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c b\u1EA5t th\u01B0\u1EDDng.\r\n- C\u1EADu
      b\xE9 v\xE0 con h\u1ED5 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EB7t ch\xE2n l\xEAn m\u1ED9t h\xF2n
      \u0111\u1EA3o. \u0110o\xE1n l\xE0 c\u1EADu ta \u0111\xE3 s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t.
      C\xF2n ch\xFAng t\xF4i th\xEC kh\xF4ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17063163479408640
    m_Localized: "C\xD3 \u0110I\u1EC6N L\u1EA0I R\u1ED2I!!! C\xC1I QU\xC1I G\xCC
      \u0110ANG DI\u1EC4N RA TH\u1EBE N\xC0Y?! Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng d\xE1m tin
      v\xE0o m\u1EAFt m\xECnh n\u1EEFa. C\xE1i qu\u1EA1t c\u0169 k\u1EF9 n\u1EB1m
      ch\u1ECFng ch\u01A1 trong g\xF3c b\u1ED7ng nhi\xEAn ph\xE1t ra ti\u1EBFng k\xEAu
      \u2014 r\u1ED3i nh\u1EEFng c\xE1nh qu\u1EA1t b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u quay t\xEDt.
      C\xF3 ph\u1EA3i c\u1EA3 l\u0169 \u0111ang \u1EA3o gi\xE1c kh\xF4ng? Kh\xF4ng.
      \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\u1EAFm s\u1EA1c \u0111i\u1EC7n
      tho\u1EA1i. C\u1EA3 m\xE1y t\xEDnh x\xE1ch tay n\u1EEFa. T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 m\u1ECDi
      th\u1EE9. Th\xF4ng b\xE1o t\u1EEB qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ED9i: h\u1ECD \u0111\xE3
      b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u tri\u1EC3n khai l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng. V\u1EDBi s\u1EF1
      \u0111\u1ED3ng l\xF2ng gi\xFAp s\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 m\u1ECDi
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, h\u1ECD \u0111ang ti\u1EBFn qu\xE2n t\u1EEB v\xF9ng n\xE0y
      sang v\xF9ng kh\xE1c. C\xE0n qu\xE9t l\u0169 zombie. Gi\u1EA3i c\u1EE9u nh\u1EEFng
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t. Hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i h\u1ECD \u0111ang
      \u1EDF c\xE1ch \u0111\xE2y kho\u1EA3ng 300 c\xE2y s\u1ED1 \u2014 h\u1ECD \u0111\xE3
      ti\u1EBFn v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa b\u1EAFc tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. Kh\xF4ng sao c\u1EA3. Th\u1EBF
      l\xE0 qu\xE1 \u1ED5n r\u1ED3i. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n bi\u1EBFt r\u1EB1ng v\u1EABn
      c\xF2n m\u1ED9t c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng b\u1ECF
      cu\u1ED9c. Kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD n\u1EEFa. Nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 khi ni\u1EC1m hy
      v\u1ECDng cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng c\u0169ng \u0111\xE3 xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n \u1EDF
      \u0111\xE2y."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17064395803672576
    m_Localized: "C\u1EA3 m\u1ED9t \u0111\xEAm tr\xF4i qua v\u1EDBi chi\u1EBFc qu\u1EA1t
      tr\u1EA7n quay l\u01B0\u1EDDi bi\u1EBFng ngay tr\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u. Th\u1EADt
      l\xE0 m\u1ED9t ni\u1EC1m h\u1EA1nh ph\xFAc thu\u1EA7n khi\u1EBFt. Chi\u1EBFc
      \u0111\xE8n ng\u1EE7 c\u0169ng \u0111\xE3 s\xE1ng tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i. Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 n\xF3i l\u1EDDi t\u1EA1m bi\u1EC7t v\u1EDBi \xE1nh tr\u0103ng
      \u2014 th\u1EE9 duy nh\u1EA5t l\xE0m b\u1EA1n v\u1EDBi c\u1EA3 l\u0169 su\u1ED1t
      nh\u1EEFng \u0111\xEAm \u0111en t\u0103m t\u1ED1i v\u1EEBa qua. Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i
      l\xE0 m\xE3i m\xE3i \u2014 ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EABn s\u1EBD th\u1EA5y tr\u0103ng
      v\xE0o m\u1ED7i bu\u1ED5i t\u1ED1i th\xF4i. Ch\u1EC9 l\xE0... th\u1EADt t\u1ED1t
      khi gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE2y ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n l\u1EF1a
      ch\u1ECDn. S\xE1ng nay, ch\xFAng t\xF4i l\u1EA1i th\u1EED g\u1ECDi \u0111i\u1EC7n
      v\u1EC1 nh\xE0 l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa. V\u1EABn m\xE1y b\u1EADn. V\u1EABn kh\xF4ng
      c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u1EA5c m\xE1y. Nh\u01B0ng c\xF3 l\u1EBD h\u1ECD \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ED9t n\u01A1i n\xE0o \u0111\xF3 an to\xE0n
      r\u1ED3i. C\xF3 l\u1EBD h\u1ECD ch\u1EC9 b\u1ECF qu\xEAn \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i
      th\xF4i. H\u1ECD s\u1EBD g\u1ECDi l\u1EA1i m\xE0. H\u1ECD nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ECBnh
      s\u1EBD g\u1ECDi l\u1EA1i. H\u1ECD ph\u1EA3i g\u1ECDi l\u1EA1i ch\u1EE9. B\u1EA7u
      tr\u1EDDi h\xF4m nay xanh ng\u1EAFt kh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t g\u1EE3n m\xE2y. M\u1ED9t
      \u0111i\u1EC1m b\xE1o t\u1ED1t l\xE0nh. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn
      tin v\xE0o \u0111i\u1EC1u \u0111\xF3."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17066298042171392
    m_Localized: "Th\u1EADt ng\u1EA1c nhi\xEAn l\xE0 c\xE1c m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 v\u1EABn
      \u0111ang ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng. M\xE0 th\u1EF1c ra, t\u1EA1i sao l\u1EA1i
      kh\xF4ng ch\u1EE9? L\u0169 zombie \u0111\xE2u c\xF3 \u0103n c\xE1p internet.
      Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 m\u1EA5y con c\xE1 m\u1EADp m\u1EDBi l\xE0m tr\xF2 \u0111\xF3
      th\xF4i =)) L\u01B0\u1EDBt qua m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t, ch\xFAng t\xF4i th\u1EA5y
      m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111ang \u0111\u0103ng b\xE0i \u2014 h\u1ECFi xem
      c\xF3 ai kh\xE1c c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t kh\xF4ng. M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 n\u01A1i
      v\u1EABn \u0111ang tr\u1EE5 v\u1EEFng. Nh\u1EEFng n\u01A1i kh\xE1c th\xEC ho\xE0n
      to\xE0n im h\u01A1i l\u1EB7ng ti\u1EBFng. Kh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t l\u1EDDi ph\u1EA3n
      h\u1ED3i. Kh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u. Ch\u1EC9 l\xE0... m\u1ED9t kho\u1EA3ng
      tr\u1ED1ng v\xF4 v\u1ECDng. Nh\u01B0ng \u0111\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi ch\xFAng t\xF4i,
      tinh th\u1EA7n c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 l\u0169 \u0111ang l\xEAn r\u1EA5t cao. K\u1EF3
      l\u1EA1 th\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA5y, ph\u1EA3i kh\xF4ng? Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xE3
      m\u1EA5t m\xE1t qu\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xF3i. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      m\u1EC7t m\u1ECFi. Th\u1EADm ch\xED ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF2n ch\u1EB3ng ch\u1EAFc
      ch\u1EAFn n\u1ED5i th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi n\xE0y c\xF2n l\u1EA1i nh\u1EEFng g\xEC.
      Nh\u01B0ng ch\u1EC9 vi\u1EC7c c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng th\xF4i \u2014 sau t\u1EA5t
      c\u1EA3 nh\u1EEFng chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y \u2014 \u0111\xE3 c\u1EA3m gi\xE1c nh\u01B0
      m\u1ED9t ph\xE9p m\xE0u r\u1ED3i. V\xEC v\u1EADy, h\xF4m nay ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      m\u1EC9m c\u01B0\u1EDDi. Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i v\xEC m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 \u0111ang
      t\u1ED1t \u0111\u1EB9p. M\xE0 l\xE0 v\xEC ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EABn c\xF2n \u1EDF
      \u0111\xE2y \u0111\u1EC3 m\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 m\u1EC9m c\u01B0\u1EDDi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17068905175400448
    m_Localized: "Qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ED9i th\xF4ng b\xE1o h\u1ECD \u0111\xE3 c\u1EED
      th\xEAm ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EBFn c\xE1c khu v\u1EF1c kh\xE1c nhau. Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i hy v\u1ECDng h\u1ECD s\u1EBD s\u1EDBm t\u1EDBi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ED7
      ch\xFAng t\xF4i. C\xE0ng s\u1EDBm c\xE0ng t\u1ED1t. L\u0169 v\u1ECBt \u0111\xE3
      quay tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i \u2014 t\u1EE5 t\u1EADp \u0111\xF4ng \u0111\xFAc ngo\xE0i
      s\xE2n v\u01B0\u1EDDn, s\u1EE5c s\u1EA1o ki\u1EBFm \u0103n nh\u01B0 th\u1EC3
      ch\u01B0a t\u1EEBng c\xF3 chuy\u1EC7n g\xEC x\u1EA3y ra. V\xE0 c\u1EA3 nh\u1EEFng
      nh\xE2n v\u1EADt m\xE0 \u0111\xE3 l\xE2u r\u1ED3i ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng
      ch\u1EA1m m\u1EB7t \u2014 m\u1EA5y con m\xE8o. Gi\u1EDD ch\xFAng g\u1EA7y \u0111i
      nhi\u1EC1u r\u1ED3i. G\u1EA7y \u0111i tr\xF4ng th\u1EA5y lu\xF4n. C\xF3 v\u1EBB
      nh\u01B0 ch\xFAng \u0111\xE3 ti\xEAu b\u1EDBt kha kh\xE1 c\xE1i l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      m\u1EE1 d\u1EF1 tr\u1EEF m\xE0 ch\xFAng t\u1EEBng tr\u01B0ng ra tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      \u0111\xE2y. Nh\u01B0ng d\xF9 sao th\xEC ch\xFAng v\u1EABn c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng.
      Nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF \u0111\xE3 l\xE0 may m\u1EAFn h\u01A1n r\u1EA5t nhi\u1EC1u
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi r\u1ED3i. L\u0169 zombie v\u1EABn \u0111ang lang thang \u0111\xE2u
      \u0111\xF3 trong khu\xF4n vi\xEAn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng. Th\u1EC9nh tho\u1EA3ng
      ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 nghe th\u1EA5y ti\u1EBFng ch\xFAng.
      Nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng sao c\u1EA3. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EDD su\u1ED1t
      hai th\xE1ng tr\u1EDDi r\u1ED3i. Tr\xF2n hai th\xE1ng. Ch\u1EDD th\xEAm v\xE0i
      ng\xE0y n\u1EEFa c\u0169ng ch\u1EB3ng ch\u1EBFt ai \u0111\xE2u. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      hy v\u1ECDng th\u1EBF."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17070198082191360
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i t\u1EC9nh gi\u1EA5c v\xEC nh\u1EEFng ti\u1EBFng
      \u0111\u1ED9ng. Ti\u1EBFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi n\xF3i. Gi\u1ECDng c\u1EE7a con
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. Ch\u1EB3ng l\u1EBD qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ED9i \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EBFn
      \u0111\xE2y r\u1ED3i sao? Kh\xF4ng. Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i h\u1ECD. \u0110\xF3
      l\xE0 m\u1ED9t nh\xF3m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tr\xF4ng v\xF4 c\xF9ng l\u1EBFch th\u1EBFch,
      nh\u1EBFch nh\xE1c. Tr\xEAn tay l\u0103m l\u0103m v\u0169 kh\xED. H\u1ECD v\u1EEBa
      \u0111\xE1nh v\u1EEBa m\u1EDF \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ti\u1EBFn v\xE0o trong khu\xF4n
      vi\xEAn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng \u2014 h\u1EA1 g\u1EE5c l\u0169 zombie d\u1EC5 nh\u01B0
      tr\u1EDF b\xE0n tay. Nh\u01B0ng tr\xF4ng h\u1ECD ch\u1EB3ng c\xF3 v\u1EBB g\xEC
      l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1ED1t c\u1EA3. M\u1ED9t k\u1EBB trong s\u1ED1 \u0111\xF3
      \u0111ang \u0111u\u1ED5i b\u1EAFt l\u0169 v\u1ECBt. \u0110\u1EC3 ti\xEAu khi\u1EC3n.
      Ho\u1EB7c l\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m th\u1EE9c \u0103n. D\xF9 l\xE0 l\xFD do
      g\xEC th\xEC ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\u0169ng ch\u1EB3ng mu\u1ED1n t\xECm hi\u1EC3u
      l\xE0m chi. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i k\xE9o s\u1EADp r\xE8m c\u1EEDa l\u1EA1i. Im l\u1EB7ng.
      Kh\xF4ng c\u1EED \u0111\u1ED9ng. Kh\xF4ng th\u1EDF m\u1EA1nh. L\xE0m \u01A1n
      \u0111\u1EEBng \u0111i l\xEAn \u0111\xE2y. Xin \u0111\u1EA5y."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17070372003201024
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i nghe l\u1ECFm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ti\u1EBFng b\u1ECDn
      h\u1ECD t\u1EEB ph\xEDa ban c\xF4ng. Nh\xF3m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF3 \u2014
      ch\xFAng l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB h\xF4i c\u1EE7a. M\u1ED9t l\u0169 b\u0103ng
      \u0111\u1EA3ng. L\u1EE3i d\u1EE5ng l\xFAc h\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3
      l\xE0m b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC ch\xFAng mu\u1ED1n. Nh\u01B0ng
      n\u1EBFu qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ED9i t\xF3m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\xFAng b\xE2y gi\u1EDD,
      coi nh\u01B0 ch\xFAng xong \u0111\u1EDDi. M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 k\u1EBB th\u1EF1c
      s\u1EF1 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 h\u1EA1 th\u1EA5p nh\xE2n ph\u1EA9m \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c
      \u0111\xF3. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i l\u1EA5y tay b\u1ECBt ch\u1EB7t mi\u1EC7ng. L\u01B0ng
      \xE9p ch\u1EB7t v\xE0o t\u01B0\u1EDDng. Kh\xF4ng m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng.
      Ch\u1EC9 m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng nh\u1ECF th\xF4i \u2014 d\xF9 ch\u1EC9
      m\u1ED9t \u2014 l\xE0 ch\xFAng s\u1EBD bi\u1EBFt ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111ang
      \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u
      l\u1EA1i ch\xFAng. C\u1EA3 l\u0169 ngay c\u1EA3 s\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EE9ng
      v\u1EEFng c\xF2n ch\u1EB3ng c\xF3. V\xEC v\u1EADy, ch\xFAng t\xF4i gi\u1EEF
      im l\u1EB7ng. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i s\u1EBD b\xE1o l\u1EA1i v\u1EDBi qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ED9i
      sau. Khi h\u1ECD \u0111\u1EBFn. N\u1EBFu h\u1ECD \u0111\u1EBFn. Ch\u1EC9 l\xE0...
      kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xFAc n\xE0y. Ch\u01B0a ph\u1EA3i l\xFAc n\xE0y."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17071525948506112
    m_Localized: "\u0110\xF3 th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t \u0111\xEAm kinh ho\xE0ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17072048684613632
    m_Localized: "H\u1ECD \u0111\u1EBFn v\xE0o l\xFAc b\xECnh minh. Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i
      l\u0169 h\xF4i c\u1EE7a \u2014 m\xE0 l\xE0 qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ED9i. Nh\u1EEFng
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\xEDnh th\u1EF1c th\u1EE5. Nh\u1EEFng chi\u1EBFc xe t\u1EA3i,
      qu\xE2n ph\u1EE5c, v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng kh\u1EA9u s\xFAng tr\xF4ng \u0111\u1EA7y
      uy l\u1EF1c. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i su\xFDt ch\xFAt n\u1EEFa \u0111\xE3 b\u1EADt kh\xF3c
      ngay khi nh\xECn th\u1EA5y h\u1ECD. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i k\u1EC3 cho h\u1ECD nghe
      t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 m\u1ECDi chuy\u1EC7n. V\u1EC1 nh\xF3m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kia.
      V\u1EC1 v\u0169 kh\xED c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng. H\u1ECD g\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA7u. Ghi
      ch\xE9p l\u1EA1i. N\xF3i r\u1EB1ng h\u1ECD s\u1EBD x\u1EED l\xFD vi\u1EC7c
      \u0111\xF3. R\u1ED3i h\u1ECD \u0111\u01B0a ch\xFAng t\xF4i l\xEAn m\u1ED9t
      chi\u1EBFc xe t\u1EA3i. Ph\xE1t ch\u0103n m\u1EC1n. N\u01B0\u1EDBc u\u1ED1ng.
      Ai \u0111\xF3 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0a cho ch\xFAng t\xF4i m\u1ED9t su\u1EA5t
      \u0103n \u1EA5m n\xF3ng \u2014 b\u1EEFa \u0103n n\xF3ng s\u1ED1t \u0111\u1EA7u
      ti\xEAn sau nhi\u1EC1u tu\u1EA7n tr\u1EDDi. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i th\u1EADm ch\xED
      c\xF2n ch\u1EB3ng k\u1ECBp n\xF3i l\u1EDDi c\u1EA3m \u01A1n. Ch\u1EC9 bi\u1EBFt
      c\u1EAFm \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE0o \u0103n. Kh\xF3c m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt. Nh\xECn khu\xF4n
      vi\xEAn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng c\u1EE9 nh\u1ECF d\u1EA7n l\u1EA1i \u1EDF ph\xEDa
      xa. L\u0169 v\u1ECBt v\u1EABn \u1EDF \u0111\xF3. M\u1EA5y con m\xE8o c\u0169ng
      v\u1EADy. Sau n\xE0y ch\xFAng t\xF4i m\u1EDBi bi\u1EBFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      \u2014 s\u1ED1 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t \u1EDF tr\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u1EA1i
      h\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u01B0? Ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EBFm tr\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u
      ng\xF3n tay. Nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 gia nh\u1EADp c\xE1c nh\xF3m
      kh\xE1c, v\xEC ngh\u0129 r\u1EB1ng t\u1EE5 t\u1EADp \u0111\xF4ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      th\xEC s\u1EBD an to\xE0n h\u01A1n? H\u1EA7u h\u1EBFt h\u1ECD \u0111\u1EC1u
      kh\xF4ng qua kh\u1ECFi. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB may m\u1EAFn.
      Ch\xFAng t\xF4i kh\xF4ng h\u1EC1 c\u1EA3m th\u1EA5y b\u1EA3n th\xE2n may m\u1EAFn.
      Nh\u01B0ng ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng. Sau 67 ng\xE0y. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      v\u1EABn c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30515385299058688
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111ang ng\u1ED3i trong im l\u1EB7ng th\xEC nghe
      th\u1EA5y ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\xF3 \u2014 c\u1ED1c. C\u1ED1c. C\u1ED1c.
      Ba ti\u1EBFng g\xF5 ch\u1EADm r\xE3i vang l\xEAn ngo\xE0i c\u1EEDa. Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i l\u1EB7ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111i. Ai c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      \u1EDF ngo\xE0i \u0111\xF3 c\u01A1 ch\u1EE9? Nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n
      s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t? X\xE1c s\u1ED1ng? Hay t\u1EC7 h\u01A1n... m\u1ED9t ai \u0111\xF3
      bi\u1EBFt ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111ang \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y?\nTi\u1EBFng g\xF5 c\u1EEDa
      d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i, nh\u01B0ng ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 nghe
      th\u1EA5y ti\u1EBFng th\u1EDF \u1EDF ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF3
      n\xEAn m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa kh\xF4ng?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30516114797576192
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB \u0103n th\xEC c\xF3 ai \u0111\xF3
      g\xF5 c\u1EEDa. Kh\xF4ng qu\xE1 to, c\u0169ng ch\u1EB3ng h\u1EC1 v\u1ED9i v\xE3
      \u2014 ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 ba ti\u1EBFng g\xF5 b\xECnh th\u1EA3n. Nh\u01B0 th\u1EC3
      m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ph\xF2ng b\xEAn sang m\u01B0\u1EE3n \u0111\u1ED3.
      Nh\u01B0ng l\xE0m g\xEC c\xF2n ai ph\xF2ng b\xEAn n\u1EEFa ch\u1EE9. Ch\u1EC9
      c\xF2n l\u1EA1i ch\xFAng t\xF4i. Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 c\u0103n ph\xF2ng n\xE0y. V\xE0
      b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 ai... hay b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 th\u1EE9 g\xEC... \u0111ang \u1EDF
      b\xEAn ngo\xE0i. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF3 n\xEAn xem \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 ai kh\xF4ng?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30516805293260800
    m_Localized: "C\u1EA3 ng\xE0y h\xF4m nay y\xEAn t\u0129nh m\u1ED9t c\xE1ch l\u1EA1
      th\u01B0\u1EDDng. Qu\xE1 \u0111\u1ED7i y\xEAn t\u0129nh. R\u1ED3i \u0111\u1ED9t
      nhi\xEAn \u2014 c\u1ED1c, c\u1ED1c, c\u1ED1c. T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      \u0111\u1EC1u nh\xECn nhau. Ch\u1EB3ng c\xF3 ai \u0111i th\u0103m ph\xF2ng
      nhau trong th\u1EDDi k\u1EF3 t\u1EADn th\u1EBF c\u1EA3. Tr\u1EEB khi... h\u1ECD
      c\u1EA7n gi\xFAp \u0111\u1EE1. Ho\u1EB7c \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 m\u1ED3i nh\u1EED.
      Ho\u1EB7c \u0111\xF3 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi.\nTi\u1EBFng
      g\xF5 c\u1EEDa \u0111\xE3 d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i, nh\u01B0ng ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EABn
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 nghe th\u1EA5y ti\u1EBFng ai \u0111\xF3 \u0111ang d\u1ED3n tr\u1ECDng
      l\u01B0\u1EE3ng thay \u0111\u1ED5i t\u01B0 th\u1EBF \u1EDF b\xEAn ngo\xE0i.
      Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF3 n\xEAn m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa kh\xF4ng?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30518344602828800
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i h\xEDt m\u1ED9t h\u01A1i th\u1EADt s\xE2u r\u1ED3i
      m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa. \u0110\xF3 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t v\xE0i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng
      s\xF3t \u2014 ki\u1EC7t s\u1EE9c, s\u1EE3 h\xE3i, nh\u01B0ng v\u1EABn c\xF2n
      s\u1ED1ng. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i cho h\u1ECD n\u01B0\u1EDBc u\u1ED1ng c\xF9ng \u0111\u1ED3
      \u0103n, v\xE0 h\u1ECD \u0111\xE3 k\u1EC3 cho ch\xFAng t\xF4i nghe nh\u1EEFng
      g\xEC \u0111ang di\u1EC5n ra b\xEAn ngo\xE0i. H\xF3a ra, c\xF3 m\u1ED9t khu
      v\u1EF1c an to\xE0n ch\u1EC9 c\xE1ch \u0111\xE2y v\xE0i d\xE3y nh\xE0. Bi\u1EBFt
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c tin n\xE0y th\u1EADt t\u1ED1t.\nH\u1ECD \u0111i sau khi
      \u0111\xE3 ngh\u1EC9 ng\u01A1i. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i hy v\u1ECDng h\u1ECD \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1EBFn n\u01A1i an to\xE0n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30874314264756224
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa. M\u1ED9t sai l\u1EA7m
      l\u1EDBn. \u0110\xF3 ch\u1EB3ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng
      s\xF3t \u2014 m\xE0 l\xE0 m\u1ED9t c\xE1i b\u1EABy. M\u1ED9t con x\xE1c s\u1ED1ng
      lao th\u1EB3ng v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa ch\xFAng t\xF4i, v\xE0 ch\xFAng t\xF4i ch\u1EC9
      v\u1EEBa k\u1ECBp d\u1EADp m\u1EA1nh c\u1EEDa l\u1EA1i trong t\xEDch t\u1EAFc.
      Nh\u01B0ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3, n\xF3 \u0111\xE3 k\u1ECBp \u0111\u1EC3
      l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t v\u1EBFt c\xE0o.\nB\xE2y gi\u1EDD ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111ang
      xoa d\u1ECBu v\u1EBFt th\u01B0\u01A1ng v\xE0 t\u1EF1 h\u1ECFi li\u1EC7u c\xF3
      ph\u1EA3i ch\xEDnh m\xECnh v\u1EEBa \u0111i t\xECm c\xE1i ch\u1EBFt kh\xF4ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30878239592235008
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i gi\u1EEF y\xEAn l\u1EB7ng. Ti\u1EBFng g\xF5 c\u1EEDa
      d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i sau v\xE0i ph\xFAt. Ti\u1EBFng b\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\xE2n d\u1EA7n
      ch\xECm v\xE0o xa x\u0103m ph\xEDa cu\u1ED1i h\xE0nh lang. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      s\u1EBD ch\u1EB3ng bao gi\u1EDD bi\u1EBFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ai \u2014 hay
      th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u2014 \u0111\xE3 \u1EDF ngo\xE0i \u0111\xF3. Nh\u01B0ng \xEDt
      nh\u1EA5t th\xEC ch\xFAng t\xF4i v\u1EABn c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng. \u0110\xFAng kh\xF4ng?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40517413513203712
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ED1ng qu\u1EA7n \xE1o
      n\xE0y h\u01A1n m\u1ED9t tu\u1EA7n nay r\u1ED3i. V\xE0 ch\xFAng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u...
      b\u1ED1c m\xF9i. B\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng, ch\xFAng t\xF4i ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n
      qu\u0103ng \u0111\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3 d\u01A1 xu\u1ED1ng qu\u1EA7y d\u1ECBch
      v\u1EE5 \u1EDF t\u1EA7ng m\u1ED9t r\u1ED3i l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i ngay trong ng\xE0y
      (si\xEAu nhanh, si\xEAu th\u01A1m tho). Nh\u01B0ng k\u1EC3 t\u1EEB khi d\u1ECBch
      b\u1EC7nh b\xF9ng ph\xE1t, d\u0129 nhi\xEAn l\xE0 ch\u1EB3ng c\xF2n ai tr\u1EF1c
      \u1EDF qu\u1EA7y n\u1EEFa.\n\nH\xF4m nay, cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      c\u0169ng li\u1EC1u m\u1EA1ng \u0111i xu\u1ED1ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i
      ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n ra v\xE0i b\u1ED9 QU\u1EA6N \xC1O S\u1EA0CH (\u01A1n tr\u1EDDi),
      v\xE0 ngay b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh ch\xFAng \u2014 m\u1ED9t h\u1ED9p \u0111\u1EF1ng
      \u0111\u1ED3 \u0103n v\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc u\u1ED1ng. C\xF3 ai \u0111\xF3 v\u1EEBa
      b\u1ECF l\u1EA1i ch\xFAng sao? Hay \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t c\xE1i b\u1EABy???
      Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF3 n\xEAn l\u1EA5y ch\xFAng hay kh\xF4ng \u0111\xE2y?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40518727009832960
    m_Localized: "\u0110\xE3 h\u01A1n m\u1ED9t tu\u1EA7n m\u1EB7c \u0111\xFAng m\u1ED9t
      b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1ED3 r\u1ED3i. M\xF9i th\xEC... \u1EEB \u0111\u1EA5y. Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i t\u1EEBng ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n mang h\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ED3 xu\u1ED1ng qu\u1EA7y
      t\u1EA7ng m\u1ED9t r\u1ED3i quay l\u1EA1i l\u1EA5y sau \u2014 nhanh g\u1ECDn
      l\u1EB9. Nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng c\xF3 nh\xE2n vi\xEAn ngh\u0129a l\xE0 ch\u1EB3ng
      c\xF3 d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 g\xEC c\u1EA3. H\xF4m nay ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111i xu\u1ED1ng
      d\u01B0\u1EDBi. T\xECm th\u1EA5y QU\u1EA6N \xC1O S\u1EA0CH (cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng
      th\xEC). V\xE0 ngay b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh ch\xFAng? \u0110\u1ED3 \u0103n v\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      u\u1ED1ng. B\u1ECB b\u1ECF l\u1EA1i? Hay l\xE0 m\u1ED9t c\xE1i b\u1EABy? Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i c\xF3 n\xEAn l\u1EA5y kh\xF4ng?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40593665389498368
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u quen d\u1EA7n v\u1EDBi c\xE1i
      m\xF9i n\xE0y r\u1ED3i. M\u1EB7c \u0111\xFAng m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc \xE1o su\u1ED1t
      c\u1EA3 tu\u1EA7n li\u1EC1n th\xEC s\u1EBD th\xE0nh ra nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy \u0111\u1EA5y.
      Qu\u1EA7y gi\u1EB7t \u1EE7i \u1EDF t\u1EA7ng m\u1ED9t t\u1EEBng l\xE0 c\u1EE9u
      tinh c\u1EE7a Ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u2014 mang \u0111\u1ED3 b\u1EA9n xu\u1ED1ng,
      l\u1EA5y \u0111\u1ED3 s\u1EA1ch v\u1EC1. B\xE2y gi\u1EDD th\xEC kh\xF4ng c\xF2n
      nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\u1EEFa. H\xF4m nay ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\xE3 \u0111i xu\u1ED1ng
      ki\u1EC3m tra. Qu\u1EA7n \xE1o s\u1EA1ch. \u0110\u1ED3 \u0103n. N\u01B0\u1EDBc
      u\u1ED1ng. Ch\u1EC9 n\u1EB1m ngay \u1EDF \u0111\xF3. Qu\xE1 t\u1ED1t \u0111\u1EC3
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0 s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt... hay \u0111\xFAng l\xE0 may m\u1EAFn
      th\u1EADt? Ch\xFAng t\xF4i c\xF3 n\xEAn m\u1EA1o hi\u1EC3m kh\xF4ng?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945449895202816
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i r\xF3n r\xE9n b\u01B0\u1EDBc xu\u1ED1ng. Ti\u1EBFng
      s\u1EA3nh ho\xE0n to\xE0n tr\u1ED1ng v\u1EAFng. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i ch\u1ED9p l\u1EA5y
      \u0111\u1ED1ng qu\u1EA7n \xE1o s\u1EA1ch c\xF9ng nhu y\u1EBFu ph\u1EA9m, r\u1ED3i
      r\xFAt \xEAm l\xEAn tr\xEAn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi c\xF3 b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 chuy\u1EC7n
      g\xEC k\u1ECBp x\u1EA3y ra. C\u1EA3 khu v\u1EF1c ch\xECm trong m\u1ED9t s\u1EF1
      im l\u1EB7ng r\u1EE3n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u2014 g\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 l\xE0 qu\xE1
      \u0111\u1ED7i y\xEAn t\u0129nh. Nh\u01B0ng m\xE0 k\u1EC7 ch\u1EE9, \u0111\u1ED3
      mi\u1EC5n ph\xED m\xE0! Gi\u1EDD th\xEC t\xEDnh ra ch\xFAng t\xF4i th\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1EA1i gia th\u1EDDi t\u1EADn th\u1EBF r\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EA5y."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40966847309025280
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i m\xF2 xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\u01B0\u1EDBi
      nh\xE0, nh\u01B0ng c\xE1i s\u1EA3nh l\u1EA1i ch\u1EB3ng h\u1EC1 tr\u1ED1ng
      v\u1EAFng nh\u01B0 ch\xFAng t\xF4i ngh\u0129. Khi v\u1EEBa v\u1EDBi tay \u0111\u1ECBnh
      l\u1EA5y \u0111\u1ED1ng nhu y\u1EBFu ph\u1EA9m th\xEC ch\xFAng t\xF4i l\u1EE1
      l\xE0m \u0111\u1ED5 m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc gh\u1EBF kim lo\u1EA1i \u2014 LO\u1EA2NG
      XO\u1EA2NG. \xC2m thanh vang v\u1ECDng kh\u1EAFp kh\xF4ng gian tr\u1ED1ng c\u1EE7a
      c\xE1i s\u1EA3nh. C\xF3 th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EADy
      t\u1EEB ph\xEDa h\xE0nh lang g\u1EA7n k\u1EC1. M\u1ED9t th\u1EE9 G\xCC \u0110\xD3
      ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 nh\xE2n vi\xEAn gi\u1EB7t \u1EE7i.\n\nCh\xFAng
      t\xF4i v\u1ED9i th\xE1o ch\u1EA1y ng\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xEAn tr\xEAn, ch\u1EC9
      k\u1ECBp v\u01A1 theo v\xE0i \u0111\xF4i t\u1EA5t s\u1EA1ch c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t
      chai n\u01B0\u1EDBc duy nh\u1EA5t \u2014 d\xF9 sao th\xEC c\xF3 v\u1EABn t\u1ED1t
      h\u01A1n kh\xF4ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40967959999156224
    m_Localized: "Ch\xFAng t\xF4i quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh \u1EDF l\u1EA1i t\u1EA7ng
      5. Qu\u1EA7n \xE1o s\u1EA1ch th\xEC th\xEDch th\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA5y, nh\u01B0ng
      s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t v\u1EABn t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n nhi\u1EC1u. Ch\xFAng t\xF4i s\u1EBD
      t\xECm c\xE1ch gi\u1EB7t \u0111\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3 n\xE0y sau \u2014 c\xF3
      khi ph\u1EA3i x\xE0i n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3ng chai ch\u0103ng? \xD4i tr\u1EDDi.
      \u0110\xE2y \u0111\xFAng l\xE0 c\xE1i ph\u1EA7n t\u1ED3i t\u1EC7 nh\u1EA5t
      c\u1EE7a th\u1EDDi k\u1EF3 t\u1EADn th\u1EBF."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
